      "description": "<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove <code>ev_op_iterations</code> from truncated by @felixhekhorn in https://github.com/NNPDF/eko/pull/459</li>\n<li>Use <code>dynamic_versioning</code> as backend by @scarlehoff in https://github.com/NNPDF/eko/pull/448</li>\n<li>X space conversion of the N3LO matching  by @giacomomagni in https://github.com/NNPDF/eko/pull/444</li>\n<li>Dynamic versioning for postrelease versions by @evagroenendijk in https://github.com/NNPDF/eko/pull/465</li>\n<li>Use user paths in genpdf if possible by @felixhekhorn in https://github.com/NNPDF/eko/pull/469</li>\n<li>Python 3.13 &amp; numpy 2.0 support by @scarlehoff in https://github.com/NNPDF/eko/pull/470</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: https://github.com/NNPDF/eko/compare/v0.15.1...v0.15.2</p>",
